## Editing this pack

Lessons live under `lessons/`. Each is a JSON file matching the
[Paktly pack format](https://github.com/rapoyrazoglu/languageApp/blob/main/docs/PACK_FORMAT.md).

The shipped sample lesson (`lessons/001-getting-started.json`) shows the
three block types — explanation, vocabulary, and exercise. Replace its
content with your real material; the validator will tell you if anything
is off.

Drop audio recordings into `media/audio/` and reference them by relative
path from inside lesson JSON, e.g. `"audio": "media/audio/hello.mp3"`.

## Validate

Always validate before publishing — saves you a round-trip.

```
paktly pack validate .
```

## Publish

When you're ready, push to the registry:

```
paktly pack publish .
```

You'll need to be logged in (`paktly login`) once.

## Versioning

Bump `manifest.json`'s `version` whenever you publish a new release. The
registry refuses to overwrite an existing `id@version` — bug fixes ship
as a new patch version.

- **MAJOR** (`1.0.0 → 2.0.0`): a lesson was deleted or its id changed.
- **MINOR** (`0.1.0 → 0.2.0`): new lessons added, no breaking changes.
- **PATCH** (`0.1.0 → 0.1.1`): typo fix, audio re-recording, no content change.

